#: src/nuvashalauncher-errors.c:107
msgid ""
"this account needs an adult to verify it before it can play, which is what "
"South Korean accounts have to do"
msgstr "该账号需要经成人验证后才能进行游戏，这正是韩国账号必须完成的步骤"

